       "hide": null,
       "html": "<p>It is O-FISH-AL!  Connor Mulvaney will be joining the Irish Life Experience Dream Team for the 2025 Summer Program!</p><p>Hi!</p><p>My name is Connor, and I am originally from Everett, Washington.  I went to school at Montana State University.  Go Cats!</p><p>I am currently a High School Computer Science Teacher in Polson, Montana.</p><p>I enjoy learning about all things science and computer-related.  When not in the classroom, I like to spend time outside biking, floating, fishing, and hiking.</p><p>I am excited to visit Ireland for the first time and spend more time with an amazing group of people-both staff and students!</p><p>I know we will have a fin-tastic time!</p>"
      }
     ],
